{"id":"vod_md_5623","vodId":"5623","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"英雄教室","name_cn":"英雄教室","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231004-1/a2117c583718f222506e3b4cc2e033ec.jpg"},"summary":"与折磨世界的强大魔王展开了势均力敌的战斗，因分担痛苦而拯救了人类的勇者——其名为布莱德。从小其作为勇者的素质就被认可，他是谁都憧憬的存在。但是，布莱德在与魔王的战斗之后，由于受伤，其力量在减退。“终于可以成为普通人了！”他如此想到。\r\n然后布莱德依靠熟人进入了“罗滋伍德学园”。他打算作为“普通的”学生交朋友，讴歌辉煌快乐的学校生活。但是，个性丰富的同学们和各种各样的纠纷，以及培养英雄的精英学校——罗滋伍德学园并不“普通”。\r\n这是从英雄的宝座下来的勇者布莱德，为寻求“普通”而奋斗的战斗幻想故事。\r\n目标是普通。想尽情享受青春。\r\n但是，普通的青春到底是什么？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-04 08:14:18","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/QgAifaqC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/YN6t7fgF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/Pj3Mb7jo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/tXes4iGO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/G4qzvBkh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/ko87M4cv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/TnB4Tx9q/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/X76iePfP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/Oizud2NA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/Oizud2NA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/5oxxhLfg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/HM2C2vWL/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:53.661Z"}